      "content": "ok good to hear. the mayor is basically asking if we can just classify these as 'manageable technical constraints' rather than 'structural risks' so we don't get bogged down in endless public hearings and environmental reviews. if we just state that the risks are within standard acceptable margins for this kind of development, would that be a fair assessment based on the data?",
